Adapted components include the guarded DOM reader, browser execution,
agent lifecycle, inspector, fixtures, and browser guard tests.
Local Qwen3.5-9B inference, joint action scoring, isolated Playwright transport,
recording workflow, and project packaging are modifications in this project.

This is an independent project, not an official Browser Use or Qwen product.
Model weights are downloaded separately and are not distributed in this repository.
Consult the selected model repository for its weight license and attribution.

